"id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-28T18:19:16Z","updated_at":"2025-01-28T18:19:35Z","body":"I've gone digging and have yet to find any evidence this feature ever actually worked from the GDScript side.\n\nEven going as far back as when Godot 4.0 started, the RenderingDevice API gets called to acquire the next image before blitting the render targets to the screen. I imagine this has consistently stayed that GDScript triggers before this is done, so I don't see how it's possible that this ever had an actual visible result.\n\nIf we can't find an example that this functionality was ever clearly supported, I'm not entirely sure this should even be exposed as it is. Perhaps someone else can provide more background on the usability of this feature being exposed to users or if it worked on some version or under some conditions?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2619744014/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2619837495","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101599#issuecomment-2619837495","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101599","id":2619837495,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cJ4w3","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-28T19:04:29Z","updated_at":"2025-01-28T19:04:29Z","body":"I looked at the history of when the function was first documented, and it was back in 2020, via ae09b55a19c956cf6dafd446c71178f6bbffd91d by @reduz \n\nThat was at the time where the `RenderingDevice` was directly implemented by the rendering API (such as Vulkan). Not sure if that made a difference?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2619837495/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]